    43	
    44	Each listed endpoint is an Application SOCKS5 proxy — TCP only; not a system VPN
    45	or system-wide routing. Configure an individual SOCKS-aware application to use
    46	the endpoint. For private hostnames, enable the application's proxy DNS, remote
    47	DNS, or SOCKS5h option so the remote SSH machine resolves the name instead of
    48	the source Mac.
